%section.band
  .prose
    %h2 Discussion
    - if giscus?
      %p Questions, photos of what you made, and bug reports. Sign in with GitHub to post.
      %script{src: 'https://giscus.app/client.js', async: true, crossorigin: 'anonymous',
              data: {repo: 'kigster/makeabox',
                    repo_id: ::ApplicationHelper::GISCUS_REPO_ID,
                    category: 'MakeABox 2.0',
                    category_id: ::ApplicationHelper::GISCUS_CATEGORY_ID,
                    mapping: 'pathname',
                    strict: '0',
                    reactions_enabled: '1',
                    emit_metadata: '0',
                    input_position: 'top',
                    theme: 'dark_dimmed',
                    lang: 'en',
                    loading: 'lazy'}}
    - else
      %p
        Questions, photos of what you made, and bug reports live on GitHub.
        = succeed '.' do
          %a{href: 'https://github.com/kigster/makeabox/discussions'} Join the discussion
